# Dispatch harness repo.
# We track the agent-harness TOOLING only — never the task state that flows
# through it (worktrees, executor dirs, reports, the ledger, repo symlinks).

# Ignore everything at the root by default …
/*

# … then allow just the harness tooling back in.
!/.gitignore
!/AGENTS.md
!/bin/
!/.dispatch/

# Within .dispatch, the ledger is per-task state, not tooling.
/.dispatch/ledger.jsonl
